# Muse · Mucha (缪斯 · 穆夏)
# After Mucha's "Byzantine Head: The Blonde": a jewelled medallion behind the figure, the hair
# breaking over the ring, gold whiplash tendrils and poppies, a frieze of fans.
# The cut-out follows a figure in one particular wallpaper, placed for a full-screen window. Set background-opacity = 0.5 in your config.
